#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.print.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.print"
msgstr "cuda.tile.print"

#: cuda.tile._stub.print:1 of
msgid "Print values at runtime from the device using Python-style syntax."
msgstr "在运行时使用 Python 风格语法从设备端打印数值。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.print:3 of
msgid ""
"Supports Python f-strings and positional arguments similar to Python's "
"built-in ``print()`` function."
msgstr "支持类似于 Python 内置 ``print()`` 函数的 f-string 与位置参数。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.print of
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.print:6 of
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Values to print. Each argument can be: - A string literal or f-string - A"
" tile value (format inferred from dtype: int→``%d``, float→``%f``)"
msgstr ""
"要打印的值。每个参数可以是：- 字符串字面量或 f-string - Tile 值（格式根据数据类型自动推断：整型→ ``%d`` ，浮点型→ "
"``%f`` ）"

#: cuda.tile._stub.print:9 of
msgid "Separator inserted between arguments (default: ``' '``)"
msgstr "参数之间插入的分隔符（默认为 ``' '`` ）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.print:11 of
msgid "String appended after the last argument (default: ``'\\n'``)"
msgstr "最后一个参数之后追加的字符串（默认为 ``'\\n'`` ）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.print:15 of
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: cuda.tile._stub.print:27 of
msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

#: cuda.tile._stub.print:29 of
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "备注"

#: cuda.tile._stub.print:30 of
msgid ""
"This operation has significant overhead, and should only be used for "
"debugging purposes."
msgstr "该操作开销较大，仅应用于调试目的。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.print:33 of
msgid ""
"F-string expressions must evaluate to tile values. Constant compile-time "
"values are supported as string-formatted segments."
msgstr "f-string 表达式必须求值为 Tile 值。常量编译期值可作为字符串格式化片段使用。"

